00:24:39.634 --> 00:24:45.734
Up next, Rudy Salas
is facing David Valadao.

00:24:45.734 --> 00:24:47.234
They're facing off
in California.

00:24:47.234 --> 00:24:48.467
They can both agree that...

00:24:56.267 --> 00:24:57.367
-What?

00:24:57.367 --> 00:24:58.634
-Next up, in Pennsylvania,

00:24:58.634 --> 00:25:01.834
Matt Cartwright is
facing off against Jim Bognet.

00:25:01.834 --> 00:25:03.033
They can both agree...

00:25:05.901 --> 00:25:09.000
What?
-That's odd.

00:25:09.000 --> 00:25:11.834
-And, finally, Raphael Warnock
and Herschel Walker

00:25:11.834 --> 00:25:13.267
are facing off in Georgia.

00:25:13.267 --> 00:25:14.501
They can both agree...

