It's all bizarre.

00:25:19.167 --> 00:25:23.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:25:23.567 --> 00:25:25.167
Well, some entertainment news.

00:25:25.167 --> 00:25:28.467
Yesterday, the new trailer for
"Avatar 2: The Way of Water"

00:25:28.467 --> 00:25:29.534
was released.

00:25:29.534 --> 00:25:30.868
And as you guys have
probably heard,

00:25:30.868 --> 00:25:32.734
they shot the third movie,
as well, at the same time.

00:25:32.734 --> 00:25:35.801
so, today, they released
a trailer for "Avatar 3."

00:25:35.801 --> 00:25:37.267
Yeah, take a look at this thing.

00:25:37.267 --> 00:25:40.200
-The way of water
connects all things.

00:25:40.200 --> 00:25:43.234
The unforgettable characters
of Pandora return,

00:25:43.234 --> 00:25:44.701
like Jake and Neytiri,

00:25:44.701 --> 00:25:48.200
along with majestic new
underwater heroes, such as...

00:25:51.367 --> 00:25:52.567
And introducing...

00:26:00.601 --> 00:26:03.734
-That looks good.

00:26:03.734 --> 00:26:05.067
Did you guys see this?

00:26:05.067 --> 00:26:07.133
Elon Musk announced that
he's working with

00:26:07.133 --> 00:26:10.734
Twitter engineers
on a reboot of Vine.

00:26:10.734 --> 00:26:12.567
Yeah, that could be ready
by the end of the year.

00:26:12.567 --> 00:26:14.334
When Viners heard
Vine might make a comeback,

00:26:14.334 --> 00:26:15.367
they were like...

00:26:15.367 --> 00:26:17.801
-Yeah, I sure hope it does.

00:26:20.634 --> 00:26:22.767
-Meanwhile, kids who
only grew up with TikTok

00:26:22.767 --> 00:26:24.501
are hearing about Vines
and thinking...

00:26:24.501 --> 00:26:27.200
-What are those?!

00:26:27.200 --> 00:26:35.100
-I mean, most people haven't
thought about Vine in a while,

00:26:35.100 --> 00:26:37.367
so they were really surprised by
the news, kind of like...

00:26:38.667 --> 00:26:40.667
[ Horn honks ]

00:26:46.234 --> 00:26:48.834
Some people think Elon Musk
is making too many changes

00:26:48.834 --> 00:26:50.033
over at Twitter
and getting carried away,

00:26:50.033 --> 00:26:51.067
kind of like...

00:26:56.434 --> 00:26:59.200
But most people are excited
for Vine to return,

00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:01.667
so here's hoping Elon
doesn't mess everything up,

00:27:01.667 --> 00:27:03.567
kind of like...

00:27:03.567 --> 00:27:05.334
-[ Sneezes ]

00:27:08.667 --> 00:27:10.567
-"Nice, Ron."

00:27:13.901 --> 00:27:15.067
Well, listen to this.

00:27:15.067 --> 00:27:17.133
Next month, a model for E.T.
used in the movie

00:27:17.133 --> 00:27:21.767
is expected to sell at auction
for $3 million.

00:27:21.767 --> 00:27:22.868
That's kind of cool,
but I don't know

00:27:22.868 --> 00:27:24.434
who's going to buy that though,
you know?

00:27:24.434 --> 00:27:27.200
I'm going to buy him!

00:27:31.167 --> 00:27:32.868
Excuse me, sir?

00:27:32.868 --> 00:27:36.100
I said, I'm gonna buy me an E.T.

00:27:36.100 --> 00:27:38.367
I've been waiting
my whole life for this moment.

00:27:38.367 --> 00:27:40.767
I can use that dang E.T.
for all sorts of things.

00:27:40.767 --> 00:27:42.234
[ Laughs ]

00:27:42.234 --> 00:27:44.901
Like what?

00:27:44.901 --> 00:27:49.434
Well, I figure I can rest my
coffee mug on his head.

00:27:49.434 --> 00:27:51.734
I can put a wig on him,
take a picture,

00:27:51.734 --> 00:27:54.400
and make it my profile picture
on my MySpace.

00:27:54.400 --> 00:27:56.133
[ Laughs ]

00:27:56.133 --> 00:27:58.868
I don't think people use
MySpace anymore.

00:27:58.868 --> 00:28:02.968
Yeah, I got all sorts of plans
for uses for an E.T.

00:28:02.968 --> 00:28:04.701
I can put him next to the dishes

00:28:04.701 --> 00:28:06.200
and make it look like
he's warshing the dishes.

00:28:06.200 --> 00:28:07.334
[ Laughs ]

00:28:07.334 --> 00:28:09.667
Oh! I can take him to
a baseball game,

00:28:09.667 --> 00:28:11.567
tell the stadium
it's his birthday,

00:28:11.567 --> 00:28:13.300
then get him on the jumbotron
and have it say,

00:28:13.300 --> 00:28:14.901
"Happy birthday, E.T." on it."

00:28:14.901 --> 00:28:17.033
And then, while everyone
is distracted wishing E.T.

00:28:17.033 --> 00:28:19.767
a happy birthday,
I can steal a bunch of hot dogs

00:28:19.767 --> 00:28:21.033
from the concession stand.

00:28:21.033 --> 00:28:22.467
Then I got my dinner for
a whole year.

00:28:22.467 --> 00:28:24.601
[ Laughs ]

00:28:27.434 --> 00:28:28.767
Sounds like a plan,

00:28:28.767 --> 00:28:31.234
but where are you going to get
$3 million to pay for it?

00:28:31.234 --> 00:28:33.167
Well, don't worry about it.

00:28:33.167 --> 00:28:35.601
Just check me out on OnlyFans.

00:28:35.601 --> 00:28:38.868
[ Laughs ]

00:28:38.868 --> 00:28:40.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:28:43.300 --> 00:28:46.334
Finally, I saw that today is
National Sandwich Day.

00:28:46.334 --> 00:28:47.567
-Yeah!
-That's today.

00:28:47.567 --> 00:28:49.267
National Sandwich Day.

00:28:49.267 --> 00:28:52.567
Hot-dog vendors were like,
"Do we celebrate this or..."

00:28:53.267 --> 00:28:55.234
It's going to be a fun weekend
here in New York City

00:28:55.234 --> 00:28:57.434
because this Sunday
is the New York City marathon.

00:28:57.434 --> 00:28:59.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:28:59.367 --> 00:29:00.567
It's this weekend.

00:29:02.467 --> 00:29:04.133
Is anyone here
running the marathon?

00:29:04.133 --> 00:29:05.601
-Yeah!
-Yeah?

00:29:05.601 --> 00:29:07.234
[ Applause ]

00:29:07.234 --> 00:29:08.501
I'm sure
that won't be the last time

00:29:08.501 --> 00:29:09.901
we hear you're running
the marathon.

00:29:09.901 --> 00:29:11.567
[ Laughter ]

00:29:11.567 --> 00:29:13.434
Good luck for you, by the way.
A little trivia for you.

00:29:13.434 --> 00:29:15.033
I heard that the fastest
marathon runners

00:29:15.033 --> 00:29:18.267
can hit a top speed
of almost 13 miles an hour.

00:29:18.267 --> 00:29:19.501
[ Audience murmurs ]

00:29:19.501 --> 00:29:21.234
Then everyone
who drives a Kia Sportage

00:29:21.234 --> 00:29:22.701
was like, "Big deal, so can we."

00:29:22.701 --> 00:29:24.033
[ Laughter ]

00:29:24.033 --> 00:29:25.501
That's right,
people from all over the world

00:29:25.501 --> 00:29:27.367
are competing in this marathon,
and it's very interesting --

00:29:27.367 --> 00:29:30.167
the city is adding some new
obstacles along the route

00:29:30.167 --> 00:29:33.267
to give runners the full
New York experience.

00:29:33.267 --> 00:29:34.901
I'll show you what I mean.

00:29:34.901 --> 00:29:36.734
In Times Square...

00:29:40.634 --> 00:29:43.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:29:43.067 --> 00:29:44.400
Yeah.

00:29:46.701 --> 00:29:48.400
Down in Staten Island...

00:29:52.334 --> 00:29:54.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:29:56.167 --> 00:29:58.000
Over in Washington Square
Park...

00:30:03.033 --> 00:30:04.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:30:06.834 --> 00:30:07.834
At this point...

00:30:11.000 --> 00:30:12.701
[ Laughter ]

00:30:12.701 --> 00:30:14.367
As they go up
near Central Park...

00:30:17.434 --> 00:30:19.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:30:19.834 --> 00:30:21.334
Right over here...

00:30:25.701 --> 00:30:27.534
[ Applause ]

00:30:27.534 --> 00:30:28.701
Very cheap.

00:30:28.701 --> 00:30:29.801
Also at this point...

00:30:33.901 --> 00:30:37.133
And finally,
once they finish the race...

00:30:40.567 --> 00:30:42.667
There you go.

00:30:42.667 --> 00:30:44.267
The runners will.

00:30:44.267 --> 00:30:47.167
Good luck to everyone
running the marathon.

00:30:47.167 --> 00:30:49.167
Meanwhile,
early on Sunday morning,

00:30:49.167 --> 00:30:51.434
Daylight Savings Time ends.

00:30:51.434 --> 00:30:53.734
So, you'll gain an hour.
That's right.

00:30:53.734 --> 00:30:54.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:30:54.968 --> 00:30:56.133
That's right.

00:30:56.133 --> 00:30:58.334
At 2:00 a.m.,
all the clocks turn back an hour

00:30:58.334 --> 00:31:01.701
