lets out an audible sigh.

00:31:01.701 --> 00:31:03.434
Whew! [ Sighs ]

00:31:03.434 --> 00:31:04.534
Well, let's get to some news.

00:31:04.534 --> 00:31:06.334
With midterms
just a few days away,

00:31:06.334 --> 00:31:09.634
