a pretty odd way.

00:31:15.501 --> 00:31:16.367
Watch this.

00:31:16.367 --> 00:31:18.434
-I will very, very, very

00:31:18.434 --> 00:31:20.567
probably do it again, okay?

00:31:20.567 --> 00:31:22.434
Very, very, very probably.

00:31:22.434 --> 00:31:24.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:31:24.234 --> 00:31:26.100
Very, very, very probably.

00:31:26.100 --> 00:31:28.634
[ Laughter ]

00:31:28.634 --> 00:31:29.934
-[ As Trump ] It's like my
favorite book,

00:31:29.934 --> 00:31:33.167
"The Very, Very, Very Probably
Hungry Caterpillar."

00:31:33.167 --> 00:31:35.334
[ Laughter ]

00:31:35.334 --> 00:31:37.834
Very, very, very, very,
probably.

00:31:37.834 --> 00:31:40.334
[ Applause ]

00:31:40.334 --> 00:31:41.400
[ Normal voice ]
It's also how Trump

00:31:41.400 --> 00:31:42.534
recited his wedding vows.

00:31:42.534 --> 00:31:44.634
[ As Trump ] I very, very,
very probably do.

00:31:44.634 --> 00:31:46.634
[ Laughter ]

00:31:47.868 --> 00:31:49.400
[ Normal voice ]
Some more news on the midterms.

00:31:49.400 --> 00:31:52.300
Oprah, who launched
Dr. Oz's career,

00:31:52.300 --> 00:31:54.767
