John Fetterman.

00:31:54.767 --> 00:31:57.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:31:58.501 --> 00:32:01.434
Apparently, this year, one of
Oprah's favorite things is...

00:32:01.434 --> 00:32:02.667
