00:32:02.667 --> 00:32:04.701
[ Laughter ]

00:32:04.701 --> 00:32:06.334
Yep, Oprah endorsed Fetterman,

00:32:06.334 --> 00:32:08.601
which explains why Dr. Oz
just tweeted this.

00:32:09.634 --> 00:32:11.701
[ Laughter ]

00:32:11.701 --> 00:32:13.033
Speaking of Oz and Fetterman,

00:32:13.033 --> 00:32:14.534
during last night's
World Series game,

00:32:14.534 --> 00:32:16.367
I don't know if you saw this,
I noticed that ads

00:32:16.367 --> 00:32:18.667
