aired back-to-back.

00:32:18.667 --> 00:32:20.767
And the timing was pretty great.
Check this out.

00:32:20.767 --> 00:32:23.934
-Together, we'll stand up
to extremism on both sides

00:32:23.934 --> 00:32:25.567
and bring balance to Washington.

00:32:25.567 --> 00:32:27.567
I'm Dr. Oz.
I approve this message.

00:32:27.567 --> 00:32:29.734
-Oz is a piece of [bleep]
in my opinion.

00:32:29.734 --> 00:32:31.868
[ Laughter ]

00:32:31.868 --> 00:32:34.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:32:40.200 --> 00:32:42.501
-Dr. Oz was like,
"The proper medical term is

00:32:42.501 --> 00:32:43.734
piece of stool sample."

00:32:43.734 --> 00:32:45.334
[ Laughter ]

00:32:45.334 --> 00:32:46.734
Well, a lot of people
are talking about this.

00:32:46.734 --> 00:32:48.200
Jeff Bezos
is thinking about buying

00:32:48.200 --> 00:32:49.367
the Washington Commanders.

00:32:49.367 --> 00:32:50.601
Did you see that? Yeah.

00:32:50.601 --> 00:32:53.501
Well, yeah, this guy
might become an NFL owner.

00:32:53.501 --> 00:32:55.367
So we decided
to ask some NFL players

00:32:55.367 --> 00:32:57.868
