from the Patriots said...

00:33:09.667 --> 00:33:12.501
Next, Andrew Van Ginkel
from the Dolphins said...

00:33:17.334 --> 00:33:19.100
Then Billy Price
from the Cardinals said...

00:33:22.300 --> 00:33:24.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:33:27.567 --> 00:33:29.634
Next, Lane Johnson
from the Eagles said...

00:33:33.501 --> 00:33:35.567
Then Brian Hoyer
from the Patriots said...

00:33:40.234 --> 00:33:43.000
And finally, Las Vegas Raiders
