00:33:47.834 --> 00:33:50.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:33:51.434 --> 00:33:52.767
Well, get this.

00:33:52.767 --> 00:33:55.667
The M.T.A. just released
a new subway bingo game

00:33:55.667 --> 00:33:58.534
