a fun experience.

00:33:58.534 --> 00:34:00.067
[ Laughter ]

00:34:00.067 --> 00:34:02.133
The M.T.A. said, "Well,
it's the least we could do."

00:34:02.133 --> 00:34:03.667
And New Yorkers were like,
"Clearly."

00:34:03.667 --> 00:34:05.734
[ Laughter ]

00:34:05.734 --> 00:34:08.634
Yep, the bingo card has things
like escalator, wooden bench,

00:34:08.634 --> 00:34:11.434
