in the face by a break dancer.

00:34:11.434 --> 00:34:13.033
It's fun.

00:34:13.033 --> 00:34:14.434
Well, hey, I saw this
for the holidays,

00:34:14.434 --> 00:34:17.100
Miller Lite is releasing
a pretty wild contraption.

00:34:17.100 --> 00:34:17.968
Take a look at this.

00:34:17.968 --> 00:34:19.334
-Beer brand Miller Lite

00:34:19.334 --> 00:34:21.734
