from the tree.

00:34:31.501 --> 00:34:33.601
[ Laughter ]

00:34:33.601 --> 00:34:37.701
-♪ I'm dreaming
of a white trash Christmas ♪

00:34:37.701 --> 00:34:39.400
[ Laughter ]

00:34:39.400 --> 00:34:41.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:34:41.167 --> 00:34:43.601
If you thought the Christmas
tree was lit before...

00:34:43.601 --> 00:34:44.567
Yeah.

00:34:44.567 --> 00:34:45.968
Kids will be like,
"I saw Mommy

00:34:45.968 --> 00:34:47.300
